    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#13$2",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, out of all the choices Miss Stone gave us after disbanding the crew, you chose to play detective, Lucian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to bluff. I know you're not afraid of me exposing you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it would let more people know the truth behind Laura's death and the conduct of the film crew, you would have gladly exposed yourself, given the right opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But not right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's over, Moira.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "You hid yourself well. A simple identity and an innocent facade were the ideal cover for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "During nearly all of the murders, you were with Tippi. That painter trusts you deeply, and was always happy to provide you an alibi... even as you left your meetings partway through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking back, every 'accident' has involved you in some way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dalton's death was caused by a prop knife being switched, which led to the former prop master being dismissed. You, naturally, took over his work, which afforded you even greater opportunities for crime.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the second 'accident'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Shelly walked into cold storage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, she had intended to kill her before that, but failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember how Shelly had a hallucination and interrupted the shoot, Madam Stone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "While she was rooted in place, unable to move, a heavy container fell from above.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saved her. Moira single-handedly held onto the rope, preventing the two of you from being harmed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was not out of the kindness of her heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the time, everyone was focused on Shelly's antics. Very few people noticed the dangling container\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let alone rushed to the other end of the rope.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, only the one who tampered with the rope in the first place could have reacted that quickly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The failed attempt revealed to all that Shelly suffered from hallucinations, which you took advantage of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew her deepest nightmares.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "She mistook me for my sister Laura, and babbled all her sinful secrets to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#15$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even to the very end, she never repented. Instead, she began to blame Laura for crossing the line... She had to die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for Marion and Michael...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Michael only ever treated me as an innocent little errand girl. He never figured out I was after his life, even entrusting me with the important matter of sneaking out of the plate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#15$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Marion? She never felt the slightest guilt for what happened five years ago. She HAD to die!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Escape? Nobody can escape!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know just how much suffering and malice my sister had to endure? Yet all she ever talked about was how much experience she was getting, and how happy she was to be part of the cast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whenever I was worried I wouldn't make it as a prop-maker, whenever I silently shed tears as the crew ostracized me... she would use herself as an example to comfort me, to encourage me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#16$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was only after she died that I learned what that 'experience' you gave her really was!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#15$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "How dare you look at me like that, Greta? Are you doubting what I just said?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#17$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely you haven't forgotten how you bribed the police and the media and suppressed the news of Laura's death. You even turned her accident into a mockery of the truth in a movie! How could she possibly rest in peace after that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Moira.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Stone has not forgotten her deeds. Rather, she is doubting your identity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "My identity? A prop-maker, an unremarkable Zalak, an avenger of crimes unanswered\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Laura had no younger sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was never a part of your life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#15$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha... What are you saying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of interrogation is this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Five years ago, after the accident, I gave Laura's family compensation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I even hired people to scour her entire family history and their circumstances, all so I could guarantee that none of them would leak the truth, not even her most distant relatives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "After Lucian told me the truth he had deduced, I was still in disbelief, so I pulled out the list of Laura's family members and checked it again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I regret to inform you... There was no 'Moira' on that list.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#16$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're lying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can explain everything that has happened to you, but you will need time to accept it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So put down the dagger, Moira.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "It should not be yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#13$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put it down...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's far too late for that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
