    },
    {
        "text": "What's with the sudden earthquake?! Somebody save me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicking Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did the plate hit something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicking Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I'd known this was coming, I'd have skedaddled out of this place already... *whimper*... What the hell is going on here...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crowdrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Crew members stream out of their rooms into the crowded corridor, none with the slightest idea what was happening."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian's shadow passes by a bevy of curses, complaints, laments, and prayers before arriving at the end of the corridor. He looks out the window."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, guys, doesn't it feel like... the plate is speeding up?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
