    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira locks the door."
    },
    {
        "text": "She does not know if the man named Lucian will catch up to her, or how long it would take."
    },
    {
        "text": "The room shakes violently, letting her know that the sabotage she performed had taken effect\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cockpit is destroyed, the engine's output is locked to its highest setting, and its route is set. The studio plate speeds up as it approaches the nearby Catastrophe... and shows no signs of stopping."
    },
    {
        "text": "In a few hours, they will find themselves with the misfortune of facing a storm... No, a trial."
    },
    {
        "text": "The vast majority of this cast and crew had to answer for the accident five years ago..."
    },
    {
        "text": "For the death of her sister."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#1$2"
