    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira mumbles to herself incessantly. She sifts through the piles of junk in the prop room, and finds an old VCR. She sets it up, and pulls out a videotape from one of her inner pockets."
    },
    {
        "text": "A videotape she has watched countless times."
    },
    {
        "text": "She presses down on the play button."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_062cg_tvnoise",
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "62_i04_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_filmprojection"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_oldtvelectricity",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "fi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 4,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The smile of a young woman appears on the screen."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Laura.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "...My sister. You're real... tell me you're real...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know whenever you laughed, there was a dimple in only your left cheek. You had big eyes with light green irises, that were always so gentle when you looked at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could peel an entire apple without breaking its skin in thirty seconds. Whenever you were happy, you'd whistle a big strong 'phweet'. You'd use Arts to make small ice crystals to use as hair clips...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You told me about your life in Wrankwood, how your very first role got edited down to only three seconds of screentime in the final cut.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You told me about how much you struggled just to get a few more scenes. While a few assholes talked about you behind your back, most of the crew still looked after you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You told me how, even though you came from a small town where you couldn't even buy a VCR, even though you had to learn a lot of things from scratch, even though opportunities that are easy for others to get are far out of reach for us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "We still shouldn't be discouraged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You never mentioned how much bullying you had to suffer through, how much pain you endured. You would go on and on about how beautiful the sunrise in Wrankwood was, looking towards the future with such firm eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You also had times when you were sad, even though you only ever mentioned how homesick you felt at night, when all was quiet and the only ones kept you company were the twin moons low in the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "You told me how alike we were, and how you had my back and would support me forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since we were little\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira suddenly stops."
    },
    {
        "text": "She shakes her head like mad, trying to force more details out of her memory."
    },
    {
        "text": "But she can say no more. She finds her memories of Laura have an unusually distinct cutoff point."
    },
    {
        "text": "They had never run through the grass together, hand in hand. They had never fallen asleep in each other's arms as their parents sang to them."
    },
    {
        "text": "As she trawls further back through her memories, every image to do with her sister is simply blank."
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "fade": true,
        "fadetime": 0.2
    },
    {
