        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The videotape ends. The television screen goes dark."
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira sees her own face reflected in it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Tears silently stream down her cheek."
    },
    {
        "text": "You were never a part of Laura's life...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Laura was never a part of yours...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... But if that's really true...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what do you even have left, Moira?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
