        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's the wind so strong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, according to the schedule, today's the day we're filming the Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hautin stands in the street of the exterior set. Thanks to the nearby storm, the once-colorful background walls are covered in a layer of dust."
    },
    {
        "text": "She never expected to experience so many twists and turns after joining the film crew. She's only ever thought about making movies. As for actually being in one... She can't stand the idea of it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... the Catastrophe Miss Stone wanted to film...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Earlier, the Catastrophe everyone was making such a fuss about had simply been a faint gray dot out in the wastes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, it has condensed into a storm that blots out the sky, a storm that refuses to allow onlookers to tear their gazes away from it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Small-scale spirals of wind formed from Originium dust circle around the plate, visible to the naked eye."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I gotta say, it really is a s-spectacular sight... If you saw a scene like this in a movie theater...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, Terra bless us. I've had such bad luck, please just let us finish filming safely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... Who cares about the shoot\u2014a safe return to central Wrankwood is good enough for me! Please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The plate responds to Hautin's prayer with an even-more-unusual-than-earlier sound and shaking."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "e"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "e",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1846_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa! What the Hitchcock was that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unlucky Stagehand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
